<header class="page-header"><h1>Work with me</h1></header>
<p>I write ExtendScript (JSX) scripts for Adobe InDesign and Illustrator. Typical jobs: building pages from a spreadsheet, batch export, find and replace across many files, sending text to a CAT tool as XLIFF and bringing the translation back, and checking for overset text or missing links before handoff.</p>
<h2>How to order</h2>
<p>Custom scripts are ordered through my Fiverr gig: <a href="https://www.fiverr.com/sho_ns/write-indesign-or-illustrator-scripts-for-batch-export-and-data-merges">InDesign or Illustrator scripts on Fiverr</a>. Packages start at $50.</p>
<p>Before ordering, send me a message there with a sample file and what you do by hand now. I'll tell you whether it can be scripted and which package fits.</p>
<h2>What I've built</h2>
<p>Scripts I sell on aescripts: <a href="https://aescripts.com/overset-fixer-pro/">Overset Fixer Pro</a>, <a href="https://aescripts.com/linksafe/">LinkSafe</a>, and <a href="https://aescripts.com/language-font-mapper/">Language Font Mapper</a>. The articles on this blog show how I work through problems like these.</p>
<h2>Limits</h2>
<p>I develop and test on Windows only. I don't write Photoshop scripts.</p>
